    "detailed_description": "Wasps have been released into the field, and it's up to you to stop them - or at least try. Pick your favorite waspkeeper, carefully choose your powerups throughout your run and you might stand a chance against them! Waspkeeper is a retro-style action roguelite game where you're going to need to make the best build you can in order to survive the longest in this field full of venomous wasps.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n&gt;Main features:<br />\r\n- Four playable characters with unique stats;<br />\r\n- Level-based system;<br />\r\n- 15+ permanent powerups;<br />\r\n- Two types of attack (auto shooting and a special beetle attack);<br />\r\n- Increasingly difficult waves of enemies;<br />\r\n- 10+ types of wasps;<br />\r\n- Retro-style graphics;<br />\r\n- Wasp counter;<br />\r\n- Time survived counter.",
